Output assets/demo.gif
Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 19
Set Width 1150
Set Height 800
Set Padding 28
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 0.02

Hide
Type "export PS1='❯ '"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "litegate status"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "clear" Enter
Type "litegate models"
Enter
Sleep 3.5s

Type "clear" Enter
Type "litegate init --key sk-lcc-demo0000000000000000000000 --tools codex --dry-run --yes"
Enter
Sleep 4s
